SUMMARY:Special Event: Tevin Davis
LOCATION:Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Tevin Davis is a multidisciplinary artist whose work spans tele
 vision\, theater\, film\, comedy\, music\, and digital media. A graduate of
  Virginia Commonwealth University with a BFA in Theatre Performance\, Tevin
  has performed professionally at theaters across the country and gained nat
 ional attention as a breakout star on Season 46 of CBS’s Survivor.\n\nSin
 ce leaving the island\, Tevin has amassed a large social media following th
 rough his political satire and cultural commentary\, most notably his viral
  impersonations of former Vice President Kamala Harris. The impression beca
 me so recognizable that Tevin eventually met Harris while dressed as her\, 
 in a viral full-circle moment. His Let Me Be Clear Tour brings that world f
 rom the screen to the stage\, combining comedy\, storytelling\, music\, and
  Tevin’s own perspective.\n\nTevin has collaborated with influential voic
 es across entertainment\, culture\, and government\, including TS Madison\,
  Patti LaBelle\, Dr. Bernice King\, governors\, legislators\, and public se
 rvants committed to using their platforms for a better way forward. He is a
 lso the creator of You’ve Been Served\, a new series mixing cooking with 
 sharp commentary on politics and culture.\n\nNamed by TheGrio as one of eig
 ht Black creators to follow\, Tevin uses laughter to tell the truth\, chall
 enge the absurd\, and remind audiences of the power of Joyful Resistance!\n
 \nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage cr
